<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\subsection{Progressive Taxation and Anti-Gambling Policies}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Steep marginal taxation and the elimination of exploitative gambling cap runaway $\Phi$ spikes:</p>
