<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\subsection{Democratized / Deliberative Futarchy}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Replace markets with rotating citizen assemblies, distributed prediction networks, and expert panels. Aggregate local knowledge fields:</p>
