<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{itemize}
\item $\zeta$-term represents energy redistributed via geozotic family networks or community lotteries.
\item Diffusion spreads stress, preventing singularities.
\item Damping $\alpha$ prevents runaway ``founder spikes.''
\end{itemize}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\subsection{Conceptual Insights}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Founder-as-survival system} creates high $\Phi$ spikes $\rightarrow$ high local stress, misaligned $\mathcal{V}$ flows, fragile society.
\item \textbf{Radical interventions} flatten $\Phi$, align $\mathcal{V}$, and structure entropy $S$, creating resilient social manifolds.
\item \textbf{Adaptive governance} ($\zeta$ term) acts as real-time corrective field, smoothing deviations from desired collective $\Phi_{\text{target}}$.
\end{enumerate}</p>
