<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Historical Roots</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Goal: Show how current pressures are not natural, but historically inherited.</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Colonial regimes:</li>
</ol>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Extractive economies required individuals to maximize productivity individually for distant rulers, creating the template for modern ‚Äúfounder-as-survivor‚Äù expectations.</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Enforced land privatization, disrupting communal ownership and coercing households to act as self-sustaining units.</p>
<ol dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary" start="2">
