<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\subsection{Limits of Market-Based Futarchy and Democratized Alternatives}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">While efficacious in theory, market reliance risks plutocratic distortions. A democratized variant employs distributed prediction networks with equal citizen tokens, multi-stage deliberative processes, and community expertise integration. Rotating assemblies and continuous feedback ensure inclusivity, with safeguards like audits and overrides preserving democratic sovereignty.</p>
