-3.113em; margin-right: 0.05em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height: 2.7em;"></span><span class="sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight"><span class="mord mathnormal mtight" style="margin-right: 0.03148em;">k</span></span></span></span><span class="vlist-s">‚Äã</span></span><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height: 0.3831em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{itemize}
\item $\zeta$-term represents energy redistributed via geozotic family networks or community lotteries.
\item Diffusion spreads stress, preventing singularities.
\item Damping $\alpha$ prevents runaway ``founder spikes.'' \citep{villani2009optimal}
\end{itemize}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\subsection{Conceptual Insights}</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">\begin{enumerate}
\item \textbf{Founder-as-survival system} creates high $\Phi$ spikes $\rightarrow$ high local stress, misaligned $\mathcal{V}$ flows, fragile society.
\item \textbf{Radical interventions} flatten $\Phi$, align $\mathcal{V}$, and structure entropy $S$, creating resilient social manifolds \citep{ostrom1990governing}.
\item \textbf{Adaptive governance} ($\zeta$ term) acts as real-time corrective field, smoothing deviations from desired collective $\Phi_{\text{target}}$ \citep{hanson2007shall}.
\end{enumerate}</p>
