<p dir="auto" class="break-words"># <span>**Appendix C: Policy Field Dynamics (Futarchy-Inspired)**</span></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**1. Target Field $\Phi_{\text{target}}(x,t)$**</span></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;">Represents desired social state (e.g., minimal stress, equitable agency distribution).</p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Dynamic adjustment of policies:**</span></p>
