<p dir="auto" class="break-words"># <span>**Appendix D: Simulation Thought Experiment**</span></p>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**1. Setup:**</span></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Lattice of nodes representing households/individuals ($x \in \Omega$)</li>
<li class="break-words">Initial scalar spikes $\Phi_{\text{individual}}$ representing founder-like pressure.</li>
<li class="break-words">Vector flows $\mathcal{V}$ modeling wealth/influence exchanges.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**2. Interventions:**</span></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Flatten $\Phi$ spikes ‚Üí $\Phi_i \to \langle \Phi \rangle_{\text{neighbors}}$</li>
<li class="break-words">Introduce geozotic minima ‚Üí distributed low-$\Phi$ wells</li>
<li class="break-words">Policy feedback ‚Üí adaptive $\Phi_{\text{policy}}$</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**3. Observables:**</span></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">$\langle \Phi \rangle$ across society</li>
<li class="break-words">$\nabla^2 \Phi$ as stress measure</li>
<li class="break-words">Total entropy $S_{\text{total}} = \int_\Omega S(x) dx$</li>
</ul>
<p dir="auto" class="break-words" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><span>**Expected outcome:**</span></p>
<ul dir="auto" class="marker:text-secondary">
<li class="break-words">Reduced maximum $\Phi$ spikes</li>
<li class="break-words">Smoother $\mathcal{V}$ flows</li>
<li class="break-words">Lower $\nabla^2 \Phi$ ‚Üí less local stress</li>
<li class="break-words">Entropy redistributed toward structured coherence</li>
