<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(220, 220, 170);">\subsection</span><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">{Continuous Feedback Dynamics}</span></span>
<span class="line"></span>
<span class="line"><span style="color: rgb(230, 230, 230);">For adaptive loops:</span></span>
